*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
