**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.

